WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.075
Recognise phishing, protect accounts and respect digital work.

00:00:05.075 --> 00:00:08.815
Do not share the OTP or follow the message’s link.

00:00:08.815 --> 00:00:14.050
Verify through the institution’s independently known website or office and report the suspicious message.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.589
Which action best protects an account?

00:00:17.589 --> 00:00:22.245
Unique passwords reduce reuse risk; MFA adds another layer of protection.
